{{!< default}}
{{!-- Template Name: Shelf --}}

{{!-- ════════════════════════════════════════
  SHELF PAGE  |  slug: "shelf"

  HOW TO ADD COVER IMAGES:
  For each card, find the <div class="sic-cover"> block.
  Uncomment the <img> tag and paste your image URL.
  The coloured background and emoji hide automatically once an image loads.

  Where to get image URLs:
  • Books: Open Library covers → https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/ISBN-L.jpg
  • Films: TMDB → tmdb.org → find film → right-click poster → copy image URL
  • Albums: Spotify → right-click album art → copy image address
  • Tools: Search "[tool name] logo PNG" → use a clean hosted URL

  HOW TO EDIT CONTENT:
  ✏️ Find the card you want, update si-title, si-meta, si-note.
  To add a card: copy a full shelf-img-card block and paste.
  To remove: delete the block.
  Re-zip and re-upload when done.
════════════════════════════════════════ --}}

